{"ep": "02", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:01.44", "end": "0:00:04.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "入学之后过了将近一个月"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:04.62", "end": "0:00:09.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就像是不断将巨石推向山顶的西绪福斯一样"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:04.62", "end": "0:00:09.22", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（西绪福斯是古希腊科林斯的国王\n由于欺骗了众神  被宙斯判罚死后永远在冥界将山下的巨石推向山顶\n但每当巨石接近山顶时都会滚下去）"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:09.57", "end": "0:00:13.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经完全满足地饱尝了这条徒步登山路线"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:13.43", "end": "0:00:16.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是就在这时  有件仿佛让我搭上性命般的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:16.84", "end": "0:00:21.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让我的平常心仿佛8.0级大地震一般动摇的事件发生了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:22.05", "end": "0:00:22.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "讨…讨厌啦"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:23.15", "end": "0:00:23.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  不"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:23.89", "end": "0:00:25.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "应该说是「开始了」比较合适吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:27.74", "end": "0:00:30.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有的话自己组建一个就好了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:30.84", "end": "0:00:31.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "社团啊！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:32.19", "end": "0:00:33.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我要你帮忙"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:34.08", "end": "0:00:36.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "名字我刚刚已经想到了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:37.31", "end": "0:00:38.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 14, "start": "0:00:40.47", "end": "0:00:44.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由稀世的怪人·凉宫春日造成的无限地狱开始了…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 15, "start": "0:00:46.28", "end": "0:00:46.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "早上好"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 16, "start": "0:00:48.77", "end": "0:00:49.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  早上好"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 17, "start": "0:00:49.81", "end": "0:00:51.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我忘记今天要值日了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 18, "start": "0:00:51.92", "end": "0:00:54.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要快点到教师办公室去拿班级日志"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 19, "start": "0:00:54.82", "end": "0:00:56.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉  我先走了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 20, "start": "0:00:57.56", "end": "0:00:59.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "班上明明也是有那种女生的…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 21, "start": "0:01:04.11", "end": "0:01:07.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  阿虚  你觉得接下来还需要什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 22, "start": "0:01:07.47", "end": "0:01:08.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 23, "start": "0:01:08.23", "end": "0:01:12.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我还是想要找到谜样的转学生！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 24, "start": "0:01:12.29", "end": "0:01:15.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拜托你说些不会让人觉得不知所云的话吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 25, "start": "0:01:16.06", "end": "0:01:18.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是SOS团需要的啊！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 26, "start": "0:01:18.37", "end": "0:01:20.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然还是很想找个谜样的转学生呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 27, "start": "0:01:20.86", "end": "0:01:23.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请先告诉我你所谓「谜样」的定义"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 28, "start": "0:01:24.15", "end": "0:01:26.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从学期开始到现在已经过了两个月"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 29, "start": "0:01:27.13", "end": "0:01:31.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而现在才转学来的人已经拥有足够资格称之为「谜样」了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 30, "start": "0:01:31.73", "end": "0:01:32.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 31, "start": "0:01:32.92", "end": "0:01:35.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许是因为老爸突然被调职了呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 32, "start": "0:01:35.34", "end": "0:01:37.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  那样实在太不自然了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 33, "start": "0:01:37.75", "end": "0:01:40.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对于你来说什么才叫自然？我倒是很想知道啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 34, "start": "0:01:42.02", "end": "0:01:44.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底会不会出现呢？谜样的转学生"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 35, "start": "0:01:46.12", "end": "0:01:50.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正对于你来说我的意见不过是耳边风而已吗…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:22.98", "end": "0:03:27.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "校园里似乎开始流传起我跟春日在密谋什么的谣言"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:28.22", "end": "0:03:30.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说啊  你跟凉宫一起到底在搞些什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:31.37", "end": "0:03:33.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "该不会是在谈恋爱吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:34.15", "end": "0:03:35.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "绝对不是！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:35.84", "end": "0:03:40.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才是最想知道我到底究竟是在做什么呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:41.03", "end": "0:03:42.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们也有点分寸吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 42, "start": "0:03:42.54", "end": "0:03:43.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经不是初中生了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 43, "start": "0:03:44.24", "end": "0:03:45.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果把操场弄得无法使用的话"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 44, "start": "0:03:46.04", "end": "0:03:47.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搞不好会被停学的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 45, "start": "0:03:49.55", "end": "0:03:54.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "希望至少长门有希和朝比奈实玖瑠学姐不要被牵连进去啊…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 46, "start": "0:03:56.13", "end": "0:03:57.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "自从SOS团宣告成立以来"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 47, "start": "0:03:58.14", "end": "0:04:01.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个原本陈设单调的文学社活动室\n开始渐渐出现了些乱七八糟的东西"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:02.14", "end": "0:04:04.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  你打算住在这里吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:06.87", "end": "0:04:09.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好想要一台电脑呢！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:10.83", "end": "0:04:13.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这个信息化的时代里如果连一台电脑都没有的话"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:13.84", "end": "0:04:15.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是不会被原谅的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:15.64", "end": "0:04:17.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你是觉得谁不会原谅啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:18.31", "end": "0:04:19.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我们去弄一台过来吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:20.25", "end": "0:04:21.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂喂  你想从哪里弄啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 55, "start": "0:04:22.40", "end": "0:04:24.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你该不会打算去抢电器行吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 56, "start": "0:04:24.39", "end": "0:04:27.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么可能！是更近的地方啦"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 57, "start": "0:04:25.25", "end": "0:04:27.25", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（电脑研究社）"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 58, "start": "0:04:28.58", "end": "0:04:30.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们好～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 59, "start": "0:04:30.50", "end": "0:04:34.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我前来征收一台电脑～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 60, "start": "0:04:36.02", "end": "0:04:37.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪个是社长？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 61, "start": "0:04:37.58", "end": "0:04:38.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么事吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 62, "start": "0:04:39.59", "end": "0:04:43.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会特地跑到电脑研究社来只可能有一件事吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 63, "start": "0:04:43.83", "end": "0:04:46.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我电脑  只要一台就可以了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 64, "start": "0:04:46.30", "end": "0:04:48.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？你突然跑过来胡说什么啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 65, "start": "0:04:48.60", "end": "0:04:49.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一台有什么关系嘛！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 66, "start": "0:04:50.06", "end": "0:04:51.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们明明有这么多的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 67, "start": "0:04:51.49", "end": "0:04:53.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说啊…还有  你们到底是什么人？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 68, "start": "0:04:53.98", "end": "0:04:56.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团团长凉宫春日"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 69, "start": "0:04:56.66", "end": "0:04:59.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这两个分别是我的部下一和部下二"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:01.38", "end": "0:05:04.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以你就废话少说快点给我一台"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:04.74", "end": "0:05:07.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凭什么啊！这当然不行了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:11.19", "end": "0:05:12.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  是这样吗"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 73, "start": "0:05:12.80", "end": "0:05:15.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我们也有自己的办法～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 74, "start": "0:05:22.86", "end": "0:05:23.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 75, "start": "0:05:28.50", "end": "0:05:29.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你想做什么啊！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 76, "start": "0:05:31.86", "end": "0:05:32.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再来一张！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 77, "start": "0:05:36.43", "end": "0:05:37.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你到底要做什么！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 78, "start": "0:05:38.83", "end": "0:05:39.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿嘿嘿"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 79, "start": "0:05:40.36", "end": "0:05:43.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可是很清楚地拍下你性骚扰的照片了哦"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 80, "start": "0:05:44.02", "end": "0:05:46.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果不想让这些照片在学校里到处流传的话"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 81, "start": "0:05:46.75", "end": "0:05:48.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就乖乖地把电脑交出来！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 82, "start": "0:05:48.96", "end": "0:05:49.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你开什么玩笑！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 83, "start": "0:05:50.17", "end": "0:05:51.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是你强行拉我去摸的！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 84, "start": "0:05:51.88", "end": "0:05:52.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是无辜的！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 85, "start": "0:05:53.82", "end": "0:05:57.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你觉得有几个人去听你解释呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:00.40", "end": "0:06:02.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在…在这里的各位社员就是我的证人！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:02.85", "end": "0:06:03.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:04.37", "end": "0:06:05.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "社长没做坏事！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:07.00", "end": "0:06:11.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那我就说你们所有社员集体**她！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:12.50", "end": "0:06:13.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说这也太…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:13.81", "end": "0:06:14.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么样？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:14.80", "end": "0:06:16.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你给还是不给？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 93, "start": "0:06:16.61", "end": "0:06:18.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉  凉宫同学…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 94, "start": "0:06:19.93", "end": "0:06:20.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 95, "start": "0:06:31.19", "end": "0:06:33.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "想要哪台你自己拿走吧…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 96, "start": "0:06:33.49", "end": "0:06:34.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "社长！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 97, "start": "0:06:35.34", "end": "0:06:36.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请振作点…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 98, "start": "0:06:37.06", "end": "0:06:38.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请打起精神来…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 99, "start": "0:06:39.05", "end": "0:06:40.50", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "部长没有做错事…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 100, "start": "0:06:39.12", "end": "0:06:41.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是什么喜剧吗…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 101, "start": "0:06:43.96", "end": "0:06:45.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪一个是最新型号的？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 102, "start": "0:06:45.50", "end": "0:06:48.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我凭什么要告诉你！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 103, "start": "0:06:52.36", "end": "0:06:53.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可恶…是那一台"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 104, "start": "0:06:54.83", "end": "0:06:59.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "昨天我去电脑专卖店向店员要了最近的新型机种一览表呢～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:00.29", "end": "0:07:02.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这一台好像没有登在上面呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:06.63", "end": "0:07:07.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这台给我"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:08.37", "end": "0:07:09.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等  等一下！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:09.60", "end": "0:07:11.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那一台是上个月刚刚买的…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:15.24", "end": "0:07:16.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拿去吧  土匪！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:17.34", "end": "0:07:19.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说得一点没错  的确是土匪"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 111, "start": "0:07:20.26", "end": "0:07:21.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  阿虚"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 112, "start": "0:07:22.18", "end": "0:07:22.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搬走"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 113, "start": "0:07:23.79", "end": "0:07:28.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是呢  这样一台最新式的电脑就被抢到手了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 114, "start": "0:07:28.37", "end": "0:07:32.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日在得知文学社没有互联网环境时"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 115, "start": "0:07:32.44", "end": "0:07:34.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又叫来了电脑研究会社长和其他人"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 116, "start": "0:07:34.48", "end": "0:07:36.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在两间活动室之间架设了局域网线"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 117, "start": "0:07:36.78", "end": "0:07:40.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并且叫他们帮忙接入了校域内网"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 118, "start": "0:07:41.02", "end": "0:07:43.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就是所谓的土匪猖獗吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 119, "start": "0:07:46.47", "end": "0:07:48.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  先回家吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 120, "start": "0:07:53.09", "end": "0:07:57.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐  你还是不要和这种奇怪的社团扯上关系比较好"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 121, "start": "0:07:58.32", "end": "0:08:00.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以后还不知道那个家伙会做出些什么呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:03.64", "end": "0:08:05.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没关系的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:10.66", "end": "0:08:12.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且你不是也在吗"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:16.83", "end": "0:08:21.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "恐怕这是这个时间平面上的「必然」呢…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:21.58", "end": "0:08:22.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:24.09", "end": "0:08:26.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且我也很在意长门同学会在这里…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:27.04", "end": "0:08:27.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在意她什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:29.24", "end": "0:08:31.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没什么的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 129, "start": "0:08:32.62", "end": "0:08:37.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小女子尚未经世事  以后也请多多关照"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 130, "start": "0:08:38.03", "end": "0:08:43.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有  请你叫我「实玖瑠」就好了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 131, "start": "0:08:45.10", "end": "0:08:47.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  等待我的下一件事是…？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 132, "start": "0:08:46.21", "end": "0:08:50.35", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "架"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 133, "start": "0:08:46.51", "end": "0:08:50.45", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "设"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 134, "start": "0:08:46.81", "end": "0:08:50.55", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "S"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 135, "start": "0:08:47.11", "end": "0:08:50.65", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "O"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 136, "start": "0:08:47.41", "end": "0:08:50.75", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "S"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 137, "start": "0:08:47.71", "end": "0:08:50.85", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "团"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 138, "start": "0:08:48.01", "end": "0:08:50.95", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 139, "start": "0:08:48.31", "end": "0:08:51.05", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "网"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 140, "start": "0:08:48.61", "end": "0:08:51.15", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "站"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 141, "start": "0:08:50.98", "end": "0:08:54.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是  这个什么网站你想要谁来做啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 142, "start": "0:08:54.59", "end": "0:08:55.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 143, "start": "0:08:55.73", "end": "0:08:57.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正你闲得要命  就你做吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 144, "start": "0:08:58.28", "end": "0:09:00.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我还得去找剩下的社员呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:01.28", "end": "0:09:02.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就在这一两天把它做好吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 146, "start": "0:09:03.91", "end": "0:09:05.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果没有先做好网页的话"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 147, "start": "0:09:05.79", "end": "0:09:07.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么活动都没法开始"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 148, "start": "0:09:12.61", "end": "0:09:13.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "做网站啊…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 149, "start": "0:09:15.18", "end": "0:09:17.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然说着这种话  但是我却很有兴趣地做了起来"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 150, "start": "0:09:18.40", "end": "0:09:21.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电脑研究社已经把几乎所有用得上的软件都安装好了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 151, "start": "0:09:21.61", "end": "0:09:22.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以做起来倒是很简单"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 152, "start": "0:09:23.33", "end": "0:09:25.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就当作是午休时间打发无聊吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 153, "start": "0:09:26.95", "end": "0:09:29.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "倒是要在上面写些什么好呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 154, "start": "0:09:29.85", "end": "0:09:34.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说  我还不知道SOS团到底是个要做什么的社团呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 155, "start": "0:09:35.14", "end": "0:09:37.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门  你有什么想写上去的吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 156, "start": "0:09:38.01", "end": "0:09:38.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 157, "start": "0:09:43.24", "end": "0:09:44.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然不关我的事"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 158, "start": "0:09:45.04", "end": "0:09:47.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过她到底能不能好好上课呢…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:01.34", "end": "0:10:02.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "糟糕  上课了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:06.72", "end": "0:10:07.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:07.98", "end": "0:10:08.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "借给你"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:10.19", "end": "0:10:11.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（海柏安的殒落）"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:10.19", "end": "0:10:11.17", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（Dan Simmons所著的科幻小说\n曾在网上幻想小说数据库(ISFDB)的Top100排名中排行第14）"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:26.42", "end": "0:10:28.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然也没什么好怀疑的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:28.84", "end": "0:10:32.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么我要这样频繁地往活动室跑呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 166, "start": "0:10:32.45", "end": "0:10:33.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 167, "start": "0:10:34.28", "end": "0:10:36.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是所谓的习性吗"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 168, "start": "0:10:36.33", "end": "0:10:36.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 169, "start": "0:10:38.72", "end": "0:10:39.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们好"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 170, "start": "0:10:41.08", "end": "0:10:43.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过这两个人是不是也很闲啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 171, "start": "0:10:44.25", "end": "0:10:45.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我也没资格说别人…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 172, "start": "0:10:46.88", "end": "0:10:48.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 173, "start": "0:10:48.61", "end": "0:10:51.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁知道  第六节课时就不在了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 174, "start": "0:10:52.64", "end": "0:10:55.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "八成又到哪里去抢夺设备了吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 175, "start": "0:10:57.28", "end": "0:10:59.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我…该不会还会像昨天一样…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:00.58", "end": "0:11:04.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没关系的  再有这种事的话我一定会全力阻止她的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:05.14", "end": "0:11:07.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的吗？谢谢你"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:08.18", "end": "0:11:09.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么就拜托你了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:10.24", "end": "0:11:11.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就请交给我吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:11.81", "end": "0:11:13.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呀呵～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 181, "start": "0:11:14.24", "end": "0:11:15.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么呀呵啊…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 182, "start": "0:11:20.20", "end": "0:11:21.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "首先是这个"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 183, "start": "0:11:21.75", "end": "0:11:25.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团成立宣言及…理念声明？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 184, "start": "0:11:27.81", "end": "0:11:28.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后是这个"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 185, "start": "0:11:29.35", "end": "0:11:30.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "锵锵锵锵～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 186, "start": "0:11:32.04", "end": "0:11:34.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要穿这个去发传单哦"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 187, "start": "0:11:34.32", "end": "0:11:35.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在哪里啊？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 188, "start": "0:11:35.53", "end": "0:11:38.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "校门口  现在还有很多学生正要回家呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 189, "start": "0:11:39.42", "end": "0:11:40.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那要穿什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 190, "start": "0:11:40.63", "end": "0:11:41.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是说你啦"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 191, "start": "0:11:42.21", "end": "0:11:43.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是实玖瑠要穿"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 192, "start": "0:11:44.26", "end": "0:11:44.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "穿什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 193, "start": "0:11:45.00", "end": "0:11:45.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "兔女郎！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 194, "start": "0:11:46.61", "end": "0:11:48.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个  那个  到底要做什么…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 195, "start": "0:11:49.14", "end": "0:11:50.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了好了  换衣服换衣服！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 196, "start": "0:11:50.85", "end": "0:11:51.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不要…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 197, "start": "0:11:51.74", "end": "0:11:52.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "少废话！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 198, "start": "0:11:52.35", "end": "0:11:53.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我脱  给我脱！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 199, "start": "0:11:55.20", "end": "0:11:56.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂！凉宫！别太过分了…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 200, "start": "0:11:57.39", "end": "0:11:58.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要——！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 201, "start": "0:11:58.69", "end": "0:12:00.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要看我——！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 202, "start": "0:12:00.80", "end": "0:12:01.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "老实点！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 203, "start": "0:12:05.97", "end": "0:12:08.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快给我全部脱光——！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 204, "start": "0:12:13.14", "end": "0:12:14.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要——！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 205, "start": "0:12:15.37", "end": "0:12:17.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至少…让我自己脱…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 206, "start": "0:12:17.51", "end": "0:12:20.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不要——！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 207, "start": "0:12:22.69", "end": "0:12:24.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以进来了哦～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 208, "start": "0:12:24.15", "end": "0:12:25.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "简直是个恶人县官"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 209, "start": "0:12:27.68", "end": "0:12:30.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么样？这样一定大受瞩目！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 210, "start": "0:12:30.84", "end": "0:12:32.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样想不受瞩目都不可能吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 211, "start": "0:12:33.01", "end": "0:12:33.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门不用穿吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 212, "start": "0:12:34.36", "end": "0:12:36.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我只买了两套而已"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 213, "start": "0:12:36.44", "end": "0:12:38.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为是全套的  贵得很呢！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 214, "start": "0:12:39.11", "end": "0:12:40.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种东西你是在哪里买的啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 215, "start": "0:12:40.87", "end": "0:12:41.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "网上订购"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 216, "start": "0:12:42.35", "end": "0:12:42.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 217, "start": "0:12:43.81", "end": "0:12:44.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么我们走了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 218, "start": "0:12:45.89", "end": "0:12:47.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要走了哦  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 219, "start": "0:12:47.73", "end": "0:12:50.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不  不要…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 220, "start": "0:12:52.55", "end": "0:12:53.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "走喽～"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 221, "start": "0:12:56.05", "end": "0:12:56.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 222, "start": "0:12:57.53", "end": "0:13:00.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我真的忍不住了…那个…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 223, "start": "0:13:01.41", "end": "0:13:03.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "祝你好运了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 224, "start": "0:13:18.39", "end": "0:13:19.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉呀呀"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 225, "start": "0:13:20.63", "end": "0:13:23.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有体温呢  摸起来温温的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 226, "start": "0:13:28.56", "end": "0:13:31.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团成立宣言及理念声明"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 227, "start": "0:13:31.67", "end": "0:13:35.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我SOS团正在广泛收集这世上一切不可思议的事情"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 228, "start": "0:13:36.35", "end": "0:13:39.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "过去曾经历过不可思议事情的人"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 229, "start": "0:13:39.25", "end": "0:13:42.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在正在面临不可思议的现象或谜团的人"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 230, "start": "0:13:43.23", "end": "0:13:46.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "或者将要在不久的将来体验不可思议之事的人"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 231, "start": "0:13:46.33", "end": "0:13:49.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果有这样的人  就请来找我们进行咨询吧！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 232, "start": "0:13:49.67", "end": "0:13:51.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们会立刻想办法帮你们解决的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 233, "start": "0:13:51.91", "end": "0:13:54.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  普通的不可思议事件恕不受理"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 234, "start": "0:13:54.66", "end": "0:13:57.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "必须是能够把我们吓一跳的不可思议事件才行"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 235, "start": "0:13:57.98", "end": "0:13:58.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这一点敬请注意"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 236, "start": "0:13:59.92", "end": "0:14:03.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像渐渐理解这个社团的存在意义了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 237, "start": "0:14:09.19", "end": "0:14:12.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "气死我了！那些白痴老师搞什么鬼啊！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 238, "start": "0:14:12.32", "end": "0:14:13.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太碍事了！太碍事了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 239, "start": "0:14:13.59", "end": "0:14:15.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "出什么问题了么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 240, "start": "0:14:15.94", "end": "0:14:16.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "问题大了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 241, "start": "0:14:17.11", "end": "0:14:20.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "传单还没有发到一半  那些老师就跑过来叫停"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 242, "start": "0:14:21.10", "end": "0:14:22.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他们以为自己是谁啊！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 243, "start": "0:14:22.75", "end": "0:14:26.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看到两个兔女郎在学校的门口发传单"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 244, "start": "0:14:26.43", "end": "0:14:28.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算不是老师也会有人来劝阻的！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 245, "start": "0:14:28.36", "end": "0:14:30.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠一下子就哭出来了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 246, "start": "0:14:30.66", "end": "0:14:32.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我还被带到学生训导室去！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 247, "start": "0:14:33.16", "end": "0:14:35.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "笨蛋手球狂冈部也叫来了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 248, "start": "0:14:35.62", "end": "0:14:37.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家都不知道该往哪里看才好了吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 249, "start": "0:14:38.89", "end": "0:14:41.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的！今天就到此为止！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 250, "start": "0:14:41.88", "end": "0:14:42.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "解散！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 251, "start": "0:14:45.75", "end": "0:14:47.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要哭到什么时候！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 252, "start": "0:14:47.27", "end": "0:14:48.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了！快给我换衣服！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 253, "start": "0:14:57.96", "end": "0:14:58.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 254, "start": "0:14:59.57", "end": "0:15:04.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果我嫁不出去了的话  你还会要我吗…？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 255, "start": "0:15:09.40", "end": "0:15:11.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这你叫我该说些什么呢  朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 256, "start": "0:15:12.06", "end": "0:15:15.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的背影就好像高考落榜的重考生"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 257, "start": "0:15:15.48", "end": "0:15:19.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "或是借钱买下一栋独幢房屋之后  立刻就被炒鱿鱼的上班族一样呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 258, "start": "0:15:20.36", "end": "0:15:23.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  还有  你怎么也开始叫我那个名字了？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 259, "start": "0:15:26.35", "end": "0:15:29.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天  凉宫春日的名字就超越了「有名」的等级"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 260, "start": "0:15:29.68", "end": "0:15:32.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一跃成为了全校学生的「常识」了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 261, "start": "0:15:33.63", "end": "0:15:34.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说阿虚啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 262, "start": "0:15:35.00", "end": "0:15:39.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来你也终于成为了\n凉宫春日和她愉快的伙伴们中的一员了啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 263, "start": "0:15:39.95", "end": "0:15:40.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "吵死了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 264, "start": "0:15:41.45", "end": "0:15:43.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "更加麻烦的是作为附赠"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 265, "start": "0:15:43.58", "end": "0:15:46.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和朝比奈学姐的名字也出现在了传闻中"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 266, "start": "0:15:47.05", "end": "0:15:49.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "昨天真是吓了一跳啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 267, "start": "0:15:49.56", "end": "0:15:51.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "竟然有兔女郎站在校门口"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 268, "start": "0:15:52.33", "end": "0:15:55.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外一个人是二年级的朝比奈学姐吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 269, "start": "0:15:55.40", "end": "0:15:58.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在你们已经是全校学生瞩目的焦点了哦"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 270, "start": "0:15:58.94", "end": "0:16:01.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个「SOS团」到底是什么呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 271, "start": "0:16:03.38", "end": "0:16:06.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去问凉宫吧  我可不知道"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 272, "start": "0:16:06.60", "end": "0:16:07.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且也不想知道"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 273, "start": "0:16:07.90", "end": "0:16:10.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们好像在做很有趣的事呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 274, "start": "0:16:10.77", "end": "0:16:13.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是我觉得那件事做得有点过分了呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 275, "start": "0:16:14.45", "end": "0:16:18.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那一天  朝比奈学姐请假了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 276, "start": "0:16:18.79", "end": "0:16:20.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么一封邮件都没有收到啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 277, "start": "0:16:20.86", "end": "0:16:22.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "都作了这么大力度的宣传了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 278, "start": "0:16:22.52", "end": "0:16:26.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就因为那宣传  现在已经没有想和这个社团扯上关系的好事之徒了吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 279, "start": "0:16:26.69", "end": "0:16:29.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我不否认的确有超群的瞩目度"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 280, "start": "0:16:29.85", "end": "0:16:33.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？实玖瑠她…今天请假了？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 281, "start": "0:16:33.73", "end": "0:16:35.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许不会再回来了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 282, "start": "0:16:35.64", "end": "0:16:37.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "希望别对她留下精神伤害…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 283, "start": "0:16:37.95", "end": "0:16:40.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难得我准备了新的服装…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 284, "start": "0:16:41.07", "end": "0:16:42.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "自己穿吧！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 285, "start": "0:16:42.54", "end": "0:16:44.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我当然也会穿啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 286, "start": "0:16:44.47", "end": "0:16:47.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是实玖瑠不在的话太无聊了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 287, "start": "0:16:47.65", "end": "0:16:49.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让长门穿也可以啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 288, "start": "0:16:49.67", "end": "0:16:51.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她一定会二话不说就穿起来的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 289, "start": "0:16:51.90", "end": "0:16:53.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外我倒是也很想看到会是什么样子"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 290, "start": "0:16:57.15", "end": "0:17:00.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团刚刚建立怎么就遭受挫折了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 291, "start": "0:17:00.77", "end": "0:17:03.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家是不是都不愿意把自己的经历说出来啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 292, "start": "0:17:03.38", "end": "0:17:04.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道想自己独占吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 293, "start": "0:17:05.33", "end": "0:17:06.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  春日啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 294, "start": "0:17:06.56", "end": "0:17:10.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种县级公立高中  怎么可能会有个阴暗角落不断冒出不可思议的谜团"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 295, "start": "0:17:10.87", "end": "0:17:15.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且还多到随便找个人问「有吗」  就会回答「有」那么多的程度啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 296, "start": "0:17:16.24", "end": "0:17:17.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你明白了吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 297, "start": "0:17:17.61", "end": "0:17:19.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其实你也应该知道的吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 298, "start": "0:17:20.27", "end": "0:17:23.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是因为那些不停蠢动无处发泄的年轻意气"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 299, "start": "0:17:23.35", "end": "0:17:26.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "导致的不爽心情把你控制住  引导了你的行动罢了吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 300, "start": "0:17:27.04", "end": "0:17:28.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也该清醒一下了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 301, "start": "0:17:28.99", "end": "0:17:32.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶快去抓个帅哥一起放学回家"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 302, "start": "0:17:32.54", "end": "0:17:34.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后星期天一起去看个电影吧！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 303, "start": "0:17:35.09", "end": "0:17:38.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后加入个运动社团尽情地大干一场吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 304, "start": "0:17:38.54", "end": "0:17:41.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以你的资质  一定马上就能够作为正式选手而活跃啦！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 305, "start": "0:17:41.87", "end": "0:17:42.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我回去了！"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 306, "start": "0:17:52.14", "end": "0:17:53.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我也回去了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 307, "start": "0:17:55.42", "end": "0:17:56.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看了吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 308, "start": "0:17:56.95", "end": "0:17:57.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 309, "start": "0:17:59.85", "end": "0:18:00.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "书"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 310, "start": "0:18:01.04", "end": "0:18:02.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…不  还没有呢"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 311, "start": "0:18:03.49", "end": "0:18:04.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要不要先还给你？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 312, "start": "0:18:05.15", "end": "0:18:06.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用还我"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 313, "start": "0:18:06.98", "end": "0:18:10.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是她还真是每句话都不超过稿纸一行的长度啊"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 314, "start": "0:18:11.39", "end": "0:18:12.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天记得看"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 315, "start": "0:18:13.74", "end": "0:18:15.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "回家后马上看"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 316, "start": "0:18:18.04", "end": "0:18:18.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 317, "start": "0:18:35.57", "end": "0:18:37.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（晚上七点  在光阳园车站前的公园等你）"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 318, "start": "0:18:37.57", "end": "0:18:38.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（等你）"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 319, "start": "0:18:38.70", "end": "0:18:41.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？阿虚你去哪？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 320, "start": "0:18:41.36", "end": "0:18:42.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "车站前"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 321, "start": "0:18:42.32", "end": "0:18:44.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不许一边吃东西一边说话"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 322, "start": "0:18:57.45", "end": "0:18:59.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天来…也可以吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 323, "start": "0:19:01.13", "end": "0:19:03.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "该不会你昨天也在这里等着吧？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 324, "start": "0:19:04.94", "end": "0:19:06.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么要特地把我叫到这里来？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 325, "start": "0:19:07.16", "end": "0:19:08.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这边"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 326, "start": "0:19:09.01", "end": "0:19:09.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 327, "start": "0:19:30.25", "end": "0:19:31.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "家里人呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 328, "start": "0:19:32.04", "end": "0:19:32.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不在"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 329, "start": "0:19:33.64", "end": "0:19:36.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃  我也看出来不在了…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 330, "start": "0:19:37.29", "end": "0:19:38.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "出门了吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 331, "start": "0:19:39.02", "end": "0:19:41.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从一开始就只有我一个人"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 332, "start": "0:19:42.20", "end": "0:19:43.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你一个人住吗？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 333, "start": "0:19:43.91", "end": "0:19:44.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 334, "start": "0:19:46.23", "end": "0:19:47.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么…有什么事"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 335, "start": "0:19:53.17", "end": "0:19:53.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喝吧"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 336, "start": "0:19:58.61", "end": "0:19:59.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好喝？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 337, "start": "0:20:02.83", "end": "0:20:03.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 338, "start": "0:20:29.63", "end": "0:20:30.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "肚子都涨了…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 339, "start": "0:20:31.82", "end": "0:20:32.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 340, "start": "0:20:32.94", "end": "0:20:36.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请问你现在能不能把叫我到这里来的理由告诉我呢？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 341, "start": "0:20:39.89", "end": "0:20:42.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "「在学校不能说的事」究竟是什么？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 342, "start": "0:20:49.06", "end": "0:20:50.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是关于凉宫春日"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 343, "start": "0:20:52.21", "end": "0:20:55.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有我"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 344, "start": "0:20:57.32", "end": "0:20:59.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想告诉你"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 345, "start": "0:21:01.97", "end": "0:21:04.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫和你…怎么了？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 346, "start": "0:21:08.61", "end": "0:21:10.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我无法将其准确地用语言表述出来"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 347, "start": "0:21:11.09", "end": "0:21:14.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "传递的信息也许会发生偏差"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 348, "start": "0:21:15.38", "end": "0:21:15.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 349, "start": "0:21:16.88", "end": "0:21:17.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听我说"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 350, "start": "0:21:20.05", "end": "0:21:23.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫春日和我不是普通人类"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 351, "start": "0:21:24.10", "end": "0:21:26.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个我或多或少能看得出来啦…"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 352, "start": "0:21:27.28", "end": "0:21:28.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是这个意思"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 353, "start": "0:21:31.11", "end": "0:21:35.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我并不是指性格上没有普遍性"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 354, "start": "0:21:36.10", "end": "0:21:37.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而是如字面所说"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 355, "start": "0:21:37.88", "end": "0:21:43.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她和我都不能被称为是和像你一样大多数的「人类」一样"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 356, "start": "0:21:43.97", "end": "0:21:49.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而由统管这个银河系的信息统合思念体制造出来的"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 357, "start": "0:21:49.60", "end": "0:21:54.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对有机生命体接触用人形终端界面"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 358, "start": "0:21:55.56", "end": "0:21:56.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是我"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 359, "start": "0:21:59.04", "end": "0:21:59.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈？"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 360, "start": "0:22:00.47", "end": "0:22:06.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "用通俗的用语来说明  就是相当于「外星人」的存在"}
{"ep": "02", "idx": 361, "start": "0:22:09.61", "end": "0:22:11.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "外…星人？"}
